/P 177 0 R
/E (This report presents the work carried out during the four-week CAD Designing Internship 2026 conducted by Nexonix Reflexo Pvt. Ltd. under the guidance of instructor Anmol Verma. The internship was organised around seven lectures and four graded assignments, and its objective was to build practical, industry-relevant competence in computer-aided design using SolidWorks Premium 2022 SP1.0.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
