>>
endobj
245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
/E (The selected project for detailed discussion is the Belt-Support Roller Unit, a compact roller carried on a fixed shaft between two supports on a common base plate. The report describes its objectives, scope and applications, the hardware and software used, the testing and verification carried out, the results obtained, the challenges faced and the improvements that could follow, such as material assignment, motion study, tolerancing and finite-element validation.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
