/E (Sketching: drawing precise 2D profiles, applying dimensions and geometric relations such as perpendicular, coincident and fixed, and bringing sketches to the Fully Defined state \(Assignment 1\).)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
