/S /P
/P 179 0 R
/E (Part modelling: creating solids with Extruded Boss/Base, Extruded Cut, Revolved Boss/Base, Chamfer and Fillet. For example, the roller wheel, bush and shaft were produced as revolved bodies, while the base plate and support were built from extrusions.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
