/E (The internship ran for four weeks. Each week combined lectures with one graded assignment, and each assignment carried a fixed due date. Table 1 summarises the programme, and the sections that follow describe each week in terms of learning topics, assignments, screenshots, skills learned and outcomes.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
