461 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 187 0 R
/E (Skills learned and outcome. I learned how mates remove degrees of freedom, why the first component is fixed, how an assembly status such as Under Defined is interpreted, and how to move from a 3D model to a dimensioned 2D drawing. The outcome was a seven-component assembly and a production-style drawing, ready for export as .SLDASM and .SLDDRW.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
