/E (For detailed discussion, the project selected from the internship work is the Belt-Support Roller Unit, which is the multi-part assembly of Assignment 3 together with its engineering drawing. It was selected because it uses almost every skill from the internship: sketching, extrusion, revolution, ribs, chamfers, patterns, mates and drafting. The unit consists of a roller wheel turning on a stepped shaft, which is carried through two flanged bushes in two upright pillow-block supports, with both supports bolted to a common base plate.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
