/E (Figure 17 compares the number of features used in each model, taken from the FeatureManager trees in the screenshots. The count rises from one feature for simple profiles in Week 1 to seven features for the mounting bracket in Week 2, which reflects the increasing use of mirror, flex and rib to capture design intent. In Week 3 the counts depend on the nature of the part: revolved parts such as the wheel \(1 feature\) and the shaft \(2 features\) need few features, while the support \(6 features\) needs several because it combines a base, a lug, a boss and a rib.)
