/Title (Assignment 2, Task 2: phone stand. A 120 mm equilateral triangle with 5 mm corner fillets was extruded 3 mm downward from the Top Plane, keeping the origin at the centre. A 30 x 5 mm slot, positioned 2 mm from the bottom edge, was repeated three times around the origin using Circular Sketch Pattern and extruded 6 mm upward to form phone-holding slots. A smaller triangle, obtained by converting the triangle's edges, offsetting them inward by 17 mm and trimming, was extruded 40 mm with a 24 degree draft to form the back support. The body was then shelled to 2 mm with the bottom face removed, and the edges were rounded with a 0.5 mm fillet.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1721 0 R
